{% set entries = craft.entries.section('labArticles').orderBy('dateCreated desc').limit(5).all() %}

<h2>Guest Entries</h2>

<p class="hint">
	Seeded state: integration on, the <code>labArticles</code> section open to
	guest submissions. Like Contact Form, a failed verification is flagged as
	<em>spam</em> &mdash; the visitor still gets the success response &mdash; so the entry
	list below is the source of truth.
</p>

<ol class="hint">
	<li>Solve the widget, submit &mdash; the new entry appears in the list below.</li>
	<li>Submit without touching the widget &mdash; same success response, but <strong>no new entry appears</strong>: the save was spam-flagged.</li>
</ol>

<form method="post">
	{{ csrfInput() }}
	{{ actionInput('guest-entries/save') }}
	{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=guest-entries') }}
	{{ hiddenInput('sectionHandle', 'labArticles') }}

	<label for="ge-title">Title</label>
	<input id="ge-title" name="title" type="text" value="Guest entry {{ random(1000, 9999) }}">

	<label for="ge-summary">Summary</label>
	<input id="ge-summary" name="fields[labSummary]" type="text" value="Submitted through the smoke lab.">

	{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

	<p><button type="submit">Submit entry</button></p>
</form>

<h3>Latest entries in labArticles</h3>
<ul>
	{% for entry in entries %}
		<li>#{{ entry.id }} &mdash; {{ entry.title }} ({{ entry.dateCreated|date('H:i:s') }})</li>
	{% endfor %}
</ul>
